# ============================================================
# IELTS Study OS — environment configuration
# ============================================================
# This is a STATIC, browser-only application (Next.js static export +
# IndexedDB). It requires NO environment variables to run or deploy.
#
# There are no required API keys, no database URL, and no server-side
# secrets. Optional AI / speech functionality is configured in-app via the
# Settings page (a public remote proxy URL only — never a provider key).
#
# If you are using a future optional AI/speech proxy backend (a separate
# service), you may configure it there. No .env values are read by the
# static site itself.
#
# Copy this file to .env only if a future local helper tool needs it.
# ============================================================
